    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision and Punishing Falls</strong>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Propel yourself upwards by strategically firing your gun, mastering unique aerial maneuvers. Every misstep means a swift, often comedic, return to the bottom, pushing you to perfect your technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799430/extras/5f7ca779b12b75b9660c47797fa793a0.poster.avif?t=1752061323\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799430/extras/5f7ca779b12b75b9660c47797fa793a0.webm?t=1752061323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799430/extras/5f7ca779b12b75b9660c47797fa793a0.mp4?t=1752061323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb Together or Compete:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the relentless climb alone and push your personal limits, or join friends in exhilarating multiplayer. Adventure upwards together, or compete to see who can reach the summit first amidst the chaos. Embrace the shared struggle and hilarious falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799430/extras/28974b89f3f37b2d21db3b435e1f8bfa.poster.avif?t=1752061323\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799430/extras/28974b89f3f37b2d21db3b435e1f8bfa.webm?t=1752061323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799430/extras/28974b89f3f37b2d21db3b435e1f8bfa.mp4?t=1752061323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by awesome games like :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pogostuck: Rage With Your Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump King</p></li></ul>",
